  "user_request_original": "Design a 22-layer planar multilayer infrared filter coating on CaF2 (Daimon-20) substrate with air incident medium at normal incidence. Use alternating ZnS and MgF2 layers starting with ZnS as layer 1. Optimize individual thicknesses for all 22 layers within bounds 50-1000 nm. Spectral range 3500-5300 nm. Maximize mean transmittance in passbands 4150-4350 nm and 4550-4750 nm. Minimize mean transmittance in stopbands 3600-4000 nm and 4850-5200 nm. Use coherent thin-film matrix method. No metal layers. Total layer count exactly 22.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design a coherent 22-layer planar filter on CaF2 with air incidence using alternating ZnS and MgF2 starting with ZnS. Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses between 50 nm and 1000 nm over 3500-5300 nm to maximize mean transmittance in 4150-4350 nm and 4550-4750 nm while minimizing mean transmittance in 3600-4000 nm and 4850-5200 nm.",
